    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beach Outlet Simulator is a first-person simulation game where you run a retail company.Expand your humble store into a huge retail company</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store in a stylish and functional way. Utilize your space to showcase your products in the most effective way possible and provide your customers with an enjoyable shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/eb4cbdc3e2a0d521789b2857a22af4e2.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/eb4cbdc3e2a0d521789b2857a22af4e2.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/eb4cbdc3e2a0d521789b2857a22af4e2.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLEANING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers care about how your store looks. The windows should be clean and there should be no trash on the floor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/39d07f06c7950c0c090e6870adf4c708.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/39d07f06c7950c0c090e6870adf4c708.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/39d07f06c7950c0c090e6870adf4c708.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRODUCT ORDERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order products and shelves on your specially designed computer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/f257a45414108924a62dff4b1419508f.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/f257a45414108924a62dff4b1419508f.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/f257a45414108924a62dff4b1419508f.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASHIER MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to be a little faster to please your customers! Pay attention to customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/14bf433dde1c6d03feb798bf217af613.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/14bf433dde1c6d03feb798bf217af613.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/14bf433dde1c6d03feb798bf217af613.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROWTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new products, expand and decorate your store with the money you earn. Customers love the difference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/b882e8522b76aab952cb8380179eae73.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/b882e8522b76aab952cb8380179eae73.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/b882e8522b76aab952cb8380179eae73.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL ACTIVITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get bored of all this, you can go jet skiing, scootering or skateboarding; you can even play basketball if you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/a8395102b0dfe260c2117fa33db77404.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/a8395102b0dfe260c2117fa33db77404.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/a8395102b0dfe260c2117fa33db77404.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beach Outlet Simulator is a first-person simulation game where you run a retail company.Expand your humble store into a huge retail company</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORE MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your store in a stylish and functional way. Utilize your space to showcase your products in the most effective way possible and provide your customers with an enjoyable shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/eb4cbdc3e2a0d521789b2857a22af4e2.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/eb4cbdc3e2a0d521789b2857a22af4e2.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/eb4cbdc3e2a0d521789b2857a22af4e2.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLEANING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers care about how your store looks. The windows should be clean and there should be no trash on the floor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/39d07f06c7950c0c090e6870adf4c708.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/39d07f06c7950c0c090e6870adf4c708.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/39d07f06c7950c0c090e6870adf4c708.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PRODUCT ORDERING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order products and shelves on your specially designed computer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/f257a45414108924a62dff4b1419508f.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/f257a45414108924a62dff4b1419508f.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/f257a45414108924a62dff4b1419508f.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CASHIER MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to be a little faster to please your customers! Pay attention to customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/14bf433dde1c6d03feb798bf217af613.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/14bf433dde1c6d03feb798bf217af613.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/14bf433dde1c6d03feb798bf217af613.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROWTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new products, expand and decorate your store with the money you earn. Customers love the difference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/b882e8522b76aab952cb8380179eae73.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/b882e8522b76aab952cb8380179eae73.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/b882e8522b76aab952cb8380179eae73.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ADDITIONAL ACTIVITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you get bored of all this, you can go jet skiing, scootering or skateboarding; you can even play basketball if you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/a8395102b0dfe260c2117fa33db77404.poster.avif?t=1737466194\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/a8395102b0dfe260c2117fa33db77404.webm?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3321090/extras/a8395102b0dfe260c2117fa33db77404.mp4?t=1737466194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
